{"id":"n67604-1-9","stage":4,"title":"에어로빅 · 健身操","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67604-1-9-1","ko":"이렇게 날씬해진 비결이 뭐예요?","zh":"您能变得这么苗条的秘诀是什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날씬해진","meaning":"修长，颀长；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"날씬하다：修长，颀长；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"날씬하다","audio":"/audio/fec6c5dc6d5202d1eaf9.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40854","senseId":"2","lemma":"날씬하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비결이","meaning":"秘诀，诀窍","explanation":"비결：秘诀，诀窍；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비결","audio":"/audio/e80595c627558639e95b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61058","senseId":"1","lemma":"비결","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"fec6c5dc6d5202d1","term":"날씬하다","zh":"修长，颀长","audio":"/audio/fec6c5dc6d5202d1eaf9.mp3","entryId":"40854","definition":"又细又长，很笔挺。","pronunciation":["날씬하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"e80595c627558639","term":"비결","zh":"秘诀，诀窍","audio":"/audio/e80595c627558639e95b.mp3","entryId":"61058","definition":"没有公之于众的自己独有的卓越方法。","pronunciation":["비ː결"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/39adec54aebbdbf74705.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67604-1-9-2","ko":"요즘 에어로빅을 배우러 다니거든요.","zh":"最近我一直在去学有氧运动呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"에어로빅을","meaning":"健身操，有氧操","explanation":"에어로빅：健身操，有氧操；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"에어로빅","audio":"/audio/eaac1289ec06723b8e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67604","senseId":"1","lemma":"에어로빅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배우러","meaning":"学，学习","explanation":"배우다：学，学习；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다니거든요.","meaning":"上班，上学，上","explanation":"다니다：上班，上学，上；거든요：礼貌地补充理由或背景。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"eaac1289ec06723b","term":"에어로빅","zh":"健身操，有氧操","audio":"/audio/eaac1289ec06723b8e56.mp3","entryId":"67604","definition":"随着欢快的音乐，像跳舞似的做各种动作且运动全身的体操。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"2c65351237177855","term":"배우다","zh":"学，学习","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3","entryId":"62088","definition":"获得新知识。","pronunciation":["배우다"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627",